<title>BRAZIL: Telebras proposes 1.878 real dividend.</title>
<headline>Telebras proposes 1.878 real dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Telebras has proposed to pay dividends of 1.878 reais per lots of 1,000 shares, the firm said in a statement sent to the local stock exchanges.</p>
<p>The proposal will be submitted to a shareholder meeting, it said. The company did not set a date for the meeting.</p>
<p>Telebras said the dividend will be adjusted by Brazil's Reference Rate (TR) between now and the date of the payment.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom, 5511 2485412))</p>
